- `normalize_values::Bool`: Centre and scale the values before fitting.
- `fit_hyperparameters::Bool`: Maximise the marginal likelihood over
- `fit_noise::Bool`: Also maximise over the nugget ratio, from
- `min_length_scale::Float64`: Smallest length scale searched; 0 means 0.01 times the widest coordinate range of the data.
- `max_length_scale::Float64`: Largest length scale searched; 0 means 10 times the widest coordinate range of the data.
- `acquisition::Symbol`: Acquisition function.
- `exploration::Float64`: Margin
- `kappa::Float64`: Width
