The symbolic derivative with respect to `var` (any other variable name is
treated as a constant).

# Throws

- `std::invalid_argument`: if the expression contains `base ^ exponent` where `exponent` is not a constant (only the constant-exponent power rule is supported).

C++ exceptions are raised as `NativeError`.

