- `f::Callback`: The function to draw: a dm::Callback subclass overriding `call(double)`.
- `from::Float64`: Left end of the range.
- `to::Float64`: Right end; must be greater than `from`.
- `n::Integer`: Number of sample points, at least 2 (default 101, as in R).
- `label::String`: Legend text; empty (the default) shows no legend.
- `color::RGB`: Line color (default red `{220, 38, 38}`).

