- `color::RGB`: Line color (default red `{220, 38, 38}`).
- `stroke_width::Float64`: Line width in pixels (default 1.5).

# Returns
`RPlot`: This plot, for chaining.
"""
qqline(self::RPlot, args...) = _Rosetta.call(1064, (self, args...))

"""
    legend(self::RPlot, labels::Vector{String}, colors::Vector{RGB}) -> RPlot

Adds manual legend rows, like R's `legend(legend = labels, col = colors)`.

Each label is paired with the color at the same position and drawn as a swatch row in
