- `region_max::Vector{Float64}`: Upper corner (min < max per axis).
- `depth::Int`: Deepest depth to create (cells already deeper are untouched).
- `region_max::Vector{Float64}`: Upper corner.
- `depth::Int`: Deepest depth.
- `factory::Function (Vector{Float64}, Vector{Float64}) -> Union{TensorBSpline, Nothing}`: Patch callback; std::nullopt leaves a cell unchanged.
