- `x::Vector{Float64}`: At least three finite nonconstant first measurements.
- `y::Vector{Float64}`: Same-length finite nonconstant paired second measurements.
- `alternative::Symbol`: TwoSided (default), Less or Greater for population rank correlation.

# Returns
`HypothesisTestResult`: statistic=rank-correlation t, parameter1=n-2, estimate1=rho, approximate p_value; no CI.
"""
